    {"title": "Correlated logs", "type": "link", "url": "/d/cinematacms-logs/cinematacms-running-logs?orgId=1&from=${__from}&to=${__to}&var-filter=trace_id%3A%22$trace_id%22&var-trace_id=$trace_id"}
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Incident tracing workflow",
      "gridPos": {"h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Start with **Recent traces by service** to find slow or failed work. Narrow with an operation name or privacy-safe span tags such as `error=true`, `domain.operation=email_delivery`, `domain.outcome=failed`, `service.role=email`, or `email.recipient_ref=<ref>`. Open a result for the span waterfall. If a log provides a trace ID, paste it into **Trace ID** and use **Correlated logs** to inspect the same incident window. A missing trace does not prove the request never ran: ordinary successful traces are sampled, while errors and incident operations are retained."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "Recent traces by service",
      "datasource": {"type": "jaeger", "uid": "victoriatraces"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 15, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5},
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "$service",
          "operation": "$operation",
          "tags": "$tags",
          "minDuration": "$min_duration",
          "maxDuration": "$max_duration",
          "limit": 50
        }
      ],
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "Trace ID lookup",
      "datasource": {"type": "jaeger", "uid": "victoriatraces"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 16, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "query": "$trace_id"}
      ],
      "options": {}
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "tags": ["cinematacms", "traces", "observability"],
